<%#
# Key: tools/built_in/shell/feedback/execution_failed
# Purpose: Shell Tool execution failure feedback.
# Used: Returned to the model in the shell Tool result when the Sandbox reports an execution error.
# Locals:
# - error_class: Safe exception class name describing the failure, or nil when the Sandbox reported no exception.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
# - Must not include the error message, which may contain paths or other private detail.
-%>
The sandbox could not run the command<% if error_class %> (<%= error_class %>)<% end %>.
